  "Main topic of the publication": "This paper investigates the role of hypoxia-inducible factor 1 (HIF-1) signaling in placental aging and its potential to provoke preterm labor. The study uses transcriptomic analysis of mouse and human placenta to demonstrate that HIF-1 stabilization is a hallmark of advanced gestational timepoints, accompanied by mitochondrial dysregulation and cellular senescence, and provides evidence for the role of placental aging in signaling that promotes the onset of labor.",
